<%# 대시보드 급상승 요약 행 — 썸네일+시간 + 제목 + 성과 배수 pill. local: score. 다국어 §7·nil 방어 AD-9. %>
<% video = score.video %>
<div class="flex items-center gap-3 py-2">
  <a href="<%= youtube_watch_url(video) %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-center gap-3 hover:text-primary-600">
    <%= render "shared/video_thumb", video: video %>
    <span class="min-w-0 flex-1 truncate break-keep text-body text-ink-body" title="<%= video.title %>">
      <%= video.title.presence || "제목 없음" %>
    </span>
  </a>
  <div class="shrink-0">
    <%= render "shared/performance_cell", multiple: score.performance_multiple, view_count: nil, needs_verification: score.needs_verification %>
  </div>
</div>
